{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After days of being held captive, you finally manage to escape from your kidnapper. However, the feeling of freedom you should feel evaporates when you realize you have the cell phone of the man who kidnapped you. The right thing to do would be to just wait for the police, but a strange feeling takes over you. There are dark secrets hidden in this cell phone, and <strong>YOU NEED TO UNCOVER THESE SECRETS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A paranormal story is an <strong>investigation</strong> and <strong>suspense</strong> game where\u00a0you must try to understand the past and secrets of the cell phone owner, through <strong>old messages</strong>, <strong>notes</strong> and <strong>mysterious apps</strong>\u00a0through a fake smartphone interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/bd2ebc02276c5f29dc880ddc82322bf6.poster.avif?t=1759907614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/bd2ebc02276c5f29dc880ddc82322bf6.webm?t=1759907614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/bd2ebc02276c5f29dc880ddc82322bf6.mp4?t=1759907614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles. Make choices. Uncover the truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game, you will have  to solve <strong>countless puzzles</strong>. With each enigma unraveled, a new door opens \u2014 and with it, you move closer to the truth. <strong>But be careful:</strong> to reach it, you will have to make important decisions. Your choices will determine the <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">fate</span></strong> of everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/9dd0347faa625e89298b348eb72b33ce.poster.avif?t=1759907614\" width=439 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/9dd0347faa625e89298b348eb72b33ce.webm?t=1759907614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grab your notebook and start investigating</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>mysterious symbols</strong>. Taking note of them will be essential if you wish to decipher them later. Ignoring them won\u2019t prevent you from completing the game or understanding the main storyline \u2014 but some dialogues and hidden lore will remain a mystery.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/e497a90a6646b5f66966d0b1333f2ba1.webp?t=1759907614\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/e497a90a6646b5f66966d0b1333f2ba1.poster.avif?t=1759907614\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=164 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>dark</strong> and <strong>fascinating</strong> world, seen through both a <strong>mobile interface</strong> and an unique <strong>hand-drawn animation</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an engaging gameplay experience focused on <strong>solving puzzles</strong> to unlock phone access, decipher the <strong>meaning of symbols</strong>, connecting <strong>story points</strong>, and making <strong>choices</strong>\u00a0that can affect your story.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative designed to keep the player <strong>immersed in the</strong> <strong>game\u2019s universe</strong> even after its conclusion.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3253170?t=1759907614","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/bc241235d5e2bbfc5fcae1c6f1577b559e94b15d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759907614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/e9383637abe83accd890a9d89f25a82113c6bdbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759907614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/e9383637abe83accd890a9d89f25a82113c6bdbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759907614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Extreme violence, blood and mutilation in hand-drawn characters."},"demos":[{"appid":3626720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After days of being held captive, you finally manage to escape from your kidnapper. However, the feeling of freedom you should feel evaporates when you realize you have the cell phone of the man who kidnapped you. The right thing to do would be to just wait for the police, but a strange feeling takes over you. There are dark secrets hidden in this cell phone, and <strong>YOU NEED TO UNCOVER THESE SECRETS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A paranormal story is an <strong>investigation</strong> and <strong>suspense</strong> game where\u00a0you must try to understand the past and secrets of the cell phone owner, through <strong>old messages</strong>, <strong>notes</strong> and <strong>mysterious apps</strong>\u00a0through a fake smartphone interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/bd2ebc02276c5f29dc880ddc82322bf6.poster.avif?t=1759907614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/bd2ebc02276c5f29dc880ddc82322bf6.webm?t=1759907614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/bd2ebc02276c5f29dc880ddc82322bf6.mp4?t=1759907614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles. Make choices. Uncover the truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game, you will have  to solve <strong>countless puzzles</strong>. With each enigma unraveled, a new door opens \u2014 and with it, you move closer to the truth. <strong>But be careful:</strong> to reach it, you will have to make important decisions. Your choices will determine the <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">fate</span></strong> of everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/9dd0347faa625e89298b348eb72b33ce.poster.avif?t=1759907614\" width=439 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/9dd0347faa625e89298b348eb72b33ce.webm?t=1759907614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grab your notebook and start investigating</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>mysterious symbols</strong>. Taking note of them will be essential if you wish to decipher them later. Ignoring them won\u2019t prevent you from completing the game or understanding the main storyline \u2014 but some dialogues and hidden lore will remain a mystery.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/e497a90a6646b5f66966d0b1333f2ba1.webp?t=1759907614\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/extras/e497a90a6646b5f66966d0b1333f2ba1.poster.avif?t=1759907614\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=164 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>dark</strong> and <strong>fascinating</strong> world, seen through both a <strong>mobile interface</strong> and an unique <strong>hand-drawn animation</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an engaging gameplay experience focused on <strong>solving puzzles</strong> to unlock phone access, decipher the <strong>meaning of symbols</strong>, connecting <strong>story points</strong>, and making <strong>choices</strong>\u00a0that can affect your story.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative designed to keep the player <strong>immersed in the</strong> <strong>game\u2019s universe</strong> even after its conclusion.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Justo Dias"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253170/c7d26ad3e53d4807a05062d2e0cdec2795fb1293/header.jpg?t=1759907614","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3253170/1716511954/7d89e04320c9b3c8a4e6b4adf35832dc3c54de08/1759906154/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759907613","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3253170/1716511954/7d89e04320c9b3c8a4e6b4adf35832dc3c54de08/1759906154/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759907613","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akama